"Make your payment directly in our bank account. Please use your Order ID as payment reference. Your order won't get approved until the funds have cleared in our account.\n"
"Account details :\n"
"\t\t\n"
"Account Name : YOUR ACCOUNT NAME\n"
"Account Number : YOUR ACCOUNT NUMBER\n"
"Bank Name : YOUR BANK NAME\n"
"\t\t\n"
"If we don't receive your payment within 48 hrs, we will cancel the order."
